  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/662675/description_8815679d-4c27-448a-8268-39fbfef443b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<h4><strong>📖 简介：</strong></h4>\n<p>End's Delight 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 的附属模组，旨在为末地增添烹饪内容！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>📦 测试版</strong></h4>\n<p>本模组目前<strong>正在开发中</strong>，因此可能会出现问题和不稳定情况。如果您希望体验，请注意：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>经常备份您的存档</strong>；</li>\n<li>在将其加入整合包之前，请确保一切运行正常；</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>🔨</strong><strong>必要依赖</strong>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p><strong>Forge：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>- Farmer's Delight</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong>Fabric：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Farmer's Delight [Fabric]</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Refabricated：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Farmer's Delight Refabricated</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>✨ 我的新模组</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🌿<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tea-aroma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tea Aroma</a></strong></p>",
